    narr:narration """This call records a ruling on how weekly reactions reach people. It opens with a [quote frame introducing the ruling](narr:Expr_20261003_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h1f5318ecf934_2), then the [ruling itself: keep the per-run bundle and add a Friday roll-up of what moved and what is still open](narr:Expr_20261003_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h1f5318ecf934_3). A [reported question asks whether the roll-up replaces the bundle](narr:Expr_20261003_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h1f5318ecf934_4), answered by the [distinction that the bundle is for the run, the roll-up for the week](narr:Expr_20261003_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h1f5318ecf934_5). The call closes with a [rejection of a daily digest, since most days carry a single run and it would repeat the bundle word for word](narr:Expr_20261003_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h1f5318ecf934_6).""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261003_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h1f5318ecf934_2> ;
